  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "q23s",
      "condition": "$\\overline{\\text{AD}}=\\overline{\\text{DC}}=\\overline{\\text{BC}}=4\\text{ cm}$이므로 $\\overline{\\text{AC}}=8\\text{ cm}$이다. 직각삼각형 $\\text{ABC}$와 $\\text{DBC}$에서 피타고라스 정리에 의해 $$\\overline{\\text{AB}} = \\sqrt{8^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{80} = 4\\sqrt{5}\\text{ (cm)}, \\quad \\overline{\\text{BD}} = \\sqrt{4^2 + 4^2} = 4\\sqrt{2}\\text{ (cm)}$$ 점 $\\text{D}$에서 변 $\\text{AB}$에 내린 수선의 발을 $\\text{E}$라 하면 $\\triangle\\text{ABD}$의 넓이는 $$\\frac{1}{2} \\times \\overline{\\text{AD}} \\times \\overline{\\text{BC}} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\overline{\\text{AB}} \\times \\overline{\\text{DE}} \\implies 4 \\times 4 = 4\\sqrt{5} \\cdot \\overline{\\text{DE}} \\implies \\overline{\\text{DE}} = \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}}\\text{ (cm)}$$ 직각삼각형 $\\text{BDE}$에서 $$\\sin x^\\circ = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{DE}}}{\\overline{\\text{BD}}} = \\frac{\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}}}{4\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10}$$",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes"
    }
  ],
  "sourceQuote": "아래 $\\angle\\text{C}=90^\\circ$인 직각삼각형"
}
